1)) 🧠 Easy difference

type = "number" → 🔢 Numbers only (0-10)
type = "tel" → ☎️ Telephone numbers (+91-9876543210)
type = "range" → 🎚️ Slider (0-100)
list → 📋 Suggestions

2)) 🧠 Easy difference

<main> → Main content
<aside> → Extra/related content
<section> → A related section of content
<div> → Generic container

3)) 🧠 Easy trick
<section> → related content with a common theme 📦
<article> → independent content that can stand alone 📰
<aside> → extra/related content 📌
<div> → general container 🧱

👉 Common theme + own heading = <section>.

4)) | Type         |    CSS written                  | Best for       |
    | ------------ | ---------------------           | -------------- |
    | **Inline**   | Inside HTML element             | One element    |
    | **Internal** | `<style>` inside <head> in HTML | One page       |
    | **External** | Separate `.css` file            | Multiple pages |






